    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atomic Raid is a 3D arcade shooter with incredible dynamic and changing gameplay every 2-3 location. Buffs and debuffs that changes your experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The technological leap of mankind did not go unnoticed from the outside. In the midst of cities, portals opened, from which swarms of merciless creatures poured in, wanting only one thing - to destroy mankind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop the invasion, people had to use nuclear arsenal, firing missiles at their own cities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone thought that this would be enough, but if the portals were corrupted, the remnants of the aliens managed to adapt, building mobile laboratories where new \u2018soldiers\u2019 were created from biomass and metal for the sole purpose of destroying mankind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible high dynamic </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything you've seen so far is crawling somewhere behind...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/9e652544f44fbf3b4add98d4ef08bef1.avif?t=1755524800\" width=243 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of buffs/debuffs to your hero and your weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be careful what you take, because every bonus changes everything.</i> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/836e32e2300c2fa84f223d3351abc621.poster.avif?t=1755524800\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/836e32e2300c2fa84f223d3351abc621.webm?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/836e32e2300c2fa84f223d3351abc621.mp4?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Careful&quot; operator Kate  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Her sarcasm is stronger than pity, so don't take her words to heart.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/b784d7b8f2c3b00c3d2d50ba07189d39.avif?t=1755524800\" width=306 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To know how good you are!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/f7367744aa9f9139feb94961393294d2.poster.avif?t=1755524800\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/f7367744aa9f9139feb94961393294d2.webm?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/f7367744aa9f9139feb94961393294d2.mp4?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay changes during the game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be ready for something new all the time!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/a282625858c509f03f3d69ce9dd35b18.poster.avif?t=1755524800\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/a282625858c509f03f3d69ce9dd35b18.webm?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/a282625858c509f03f3d69ce9dd35b18.mp4?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So hop in and fasten your seatbelts. Lots of enemies, speed and fun included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
