_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/a282625858c509f03f3d69ce9dd35b18.webm?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196730/extras/a282625858c509f03f3d69ce9dd35b18.mp4?t=1755524800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So hop in and fasten your seatbelts. Lots of enemies, speed and fun included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Incredible drive, endless ammunition and Kate's \u201ccaring\u201d support, and ahead - a horde of enemies eager to destroy humanity. Will you be able to stop them? A 3D rail shooter inspired by classic arcade machines with the addition of modern mechanics and online leaderboards.. It won't be boring.",
